  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "3 large shallots, sliced thinly",
    "4 cloves garlic, chopped",
    "1.5 cups white wine",
    "ground white pepper to taste",
    "0.75 cup heavy cream at room temperature",
    "1 lemon, juiced",
    "salt to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JBqTH5Cpz7V6Aoah8p0nsF9hwTM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26311-white-wine-and-garlic-dream-cream-DDMFS-step-1-BG-7408-4ea59d01b59440679fdd21a4bf2e64e5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26311/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a medium saucepan over low heat. Cook and stir shallots in butter until translucent and tender, 2 to 3 minutes. Stir in garlic; cook until tender and aromatic, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TkJiHeoA8k8awg_PVrzwsXJ9a1A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26311-white-wine-and-garlic-dream-cream-DDMFS-step-3-BG-7416-dc8b08a71b2a48ac869d8889dccade9c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26311/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in 1 cup white wine, increase heat to high, and bring to a boil. Add remaining 1/2 cup wine; boil for 10 minutes, then reduce heat to medium-low. Season with white pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dFOXWIyW95uMkhHCpqv3NWW6ZcQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26311-white-wine-and-garlic-dream-cream-DDMFS-step-5-BG-7428-3a1856e2e734450eb536214a05cb1d7d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26311/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When sauce is no longer boiling, slowly stir in cream, lemon juice, and salt. Simmer until thickened, 3 to 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
